connect to websocket "ws://127.0.0.1:18765/chat" using protocol "chat" and call it socket
got is 0
on open of socket
    say "open; state:" state of socket "protocol:" protocol of socket
    send "hello" through socket
    data is bytes from text "raw"
    send data through socket
.
on message from socket
    say "message:" received message
    got is got plus 1
    if got is 2
        send "bye" through socket
    .
.
on close of socket
    say "closed with code" close code "reason:" close reason "clean:" close was clean
    say "state now:" state of socket
.
on error of socket
    say "error:" websocket error
.
